          "id": "8011039beabe918c2d0445dacec27c7ac6377551",
          "message": "research(ql): design record — broaden the CQ-shape gate + de-experimentalise the pr:QL arm where sound (sq-pbz04.3) [FABLE-5] (#1436)\n\nDecomposition record for epic sq-pbz04.3: five broadenings with written\nsoundness arguments (UCQ input, literal-object atoms, distinguished-var\nFILTER, constant VALUES, non-recursive path desugaring), one deliberate\nnarrowing (the intensional-atom guard), two newly-documented graduation\ntraps (TBox-capture accounting hole; certain-answer vs entailment-regime\ndivergence), a conjunctive graduation predicate for the sound pr:QL\nsubset, and five disjoint child beads (sq-pbz04.3.1-.5). No code changes.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Wright <jmwright.045@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable <noreply@anthropic.com>",
